[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2546262991","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99050#issuecomment-2546262991","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99050","id":2546262991,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XxOPP","user":{"login":"havi05","id":71942164,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTQyMTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71942164?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05","html_url":"https://github.com/havi05","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T17:45:33Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T17:45:33Z","body":"I have added an `wraparound_items` boolean, because I noticed that the horizontal scroll bar was breaking some UI's, like the file selection dialog of the `Project Manager`. (All Items were in a row before the last force-push and did not fill the space.) \r\n\r\nThe boolean `wraparound_items` is set to `true` by default and dosn't change the behavior of the `ItemLists` (compared to before this pr), so it shouldn't be a breaking change.\r\n\r\nIf it is set to `true`, all items will be moved to the next row, if there isn't enough space. (as was the case before this pr.)\r\nIf it is set to `false`, a horizontal scroll bar is added and the maximum scroll value is set to show all columns set in `max_column`. \r\n(If `wraparound_items = false` and `max_columns = 0 ` unlimited columns will be generated.)\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you have any suggestions for improving the wording of the documentation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2546262991/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2584469789","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99050#issuecomment-2584469789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99050","id":2584469789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aC-Ed","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T22:09:34Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T22:09:34Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2584469789/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0